    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the fruit layer: Mix strawberries, rhubarb, white sugar, and flour together in a large bowl. Place the mixture in a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wYQgOo7khdpQ6K0fWP3VRWc_hhw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12177-rhubarb-strawberry-crunch-ddmfs-step2-033-4x3-7fb6dcb5c0c24401abebe705709f9c7a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12177/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the crisp topping: Combine 1 ½ cups flour, brown sugar, oats, and butter and mix until crumbly. You may want to use a pastry cutter for this. Sprinkle on top of the rhubarb and strawberry layer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TEOIc1j6xTFCtz1uyvQdlCvz-Lk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12177-rhubarb-strawberry-crunch-ddmfs-step3-035-4x3-e17d9922310e4d17aaa44446bd867f17.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12177/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until crisp and lightly browned, about 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2f9Z4k-7idZfwGisUgQyS-cpWJc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12177-rhubarb-strawberry-crunch-ddmfs-step4-097-4x3-62b1b7966349462f8ac6b393795ac72b.jpg"
